function startTimer(){tRec=buildRecipe(state);initAudio();tStart=Date.now();tPausedAccum=0;tPauseStart=0;tRunning=true;tLastIdx=-1;tLastTick=-1;tDone=false;renderTimerSteps();document.getElementById("tPause").textContent=tr("Pause");document.getElementById("timerOverlay").classList.add("show");if(tInterval)clearInterval(tInterval);tInterval=setInterval(tick,100);tick();}
function tick(){if(!tRunning)return;var E=(Date.now()-tStart-tPausedAccum)/1000;tElapsed=E;var ps=tRec.pours,idx=0;for(var i=0;i<ps.length;i++){if(ps[i].t<=E)idx=i;}var nextI=(idx<ps.length-1)?idx+1:-1;var cur=ps[idx];
document.getElementById("tTime").textContent=fmt(Math.floor(E));
document.getElementById("tTarget").textContent=(cur.pour>0?P("pour to "+cur.cum+"ml","اسكب حتى "+cur.cum+"مل"):plab(cur.label)+" · "+cur.cum+P("ml","مل"));
document.getElementById("tNote").textContent=tr(cur.note||"");
var ring=document.getElementById("tRing");var ringEl=document.querySelector(".tov-ring");var stEl=document.getElementById("tState");var _cl=document.getElementById("tClose");if(_cl){_cl.textContent=(tElapsed>=60)?P("Done","تم"):P("Close","إغلاق");}
var segStart=cur.t,segEnd=(nextI>=0?ps[nextI].t:tRec.finishHi);var segLen=Math.max(1,segEnd-segStart);var segProg=Math.min(1,Math.max(0,(E-segStart)/segLen));
if(ring){ring.style.strokeDashoffset=(678.6*(1-segProg));}
var pourWindow=(cur.pour>0&&(E-segStart)<10);
if(stEl&&ringEl){if(tDone){stEl.textContent=P("DRAWING","تصفية");stEl.className="tov-state done";ringEl.className="tov-ring";var _tg=document.getElementById("tTarget");if(_tg)_tg.textContent=P("tap Done when ready","اضغط تم عند الانتهاء");}
else if(pourWindow){stEl.textContent=P("POUR","اسكب");stEl.className="tov-state pour";ringEl.className="tov-ring pour";}
else{stEl.textContent=P("WAIT","انتظر");stEl.className="tov-state wait";ringEl.className="tov-ring";}}
var nx=document.getElementById("tNext");
if(nextI>=0){var secs=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(ps[nextI].t-E));var when=(secs<=0)?P("now","الآن"):(secs+P("s","ث"));nx.innerHTML=P("Coming up","التالي")+':  <b>'+plab(ps[nextI].label)+'</b> · '+ps[nextI].cum+P("ml","مل")+'  <span class="tnext-in">'+P("in ","بعد ")+when+'</span>';}
else if(E<tRec.finishHi){nx.textContent=P("Let it drain — expected ","اتركه يتصرّف — متوقع ")+tRec.finishRange;}
else{nx.textContent=P("Done — enjoy.","انتهى — بالهناء والعافية.");}
for(var j=0;j<ps.length;j++){var se=document.getElementById("tstep"+j);if(se)se.className="tstep"+(j===idx?" active":(j<idx?" done":""));}
if(idx!==tLastIdx){if(tLastIdx>=0)beep(880,0.18,0.28);tLastIdx=idx;}
if(nextI>=0){var rem=Math.ceil(ps[nextI].t-E);if(rem<=3&&rem>=1&&rem!==tLastTick){beep(1320,0.05,0.14);tLastTick=rem;}}
if(!tDone&&E>=tRec.finishSec){tDone=true;beep(587,0.5,0.32);}
}
document.getElementById("tPause").addEventListener("click",function(){if(tRunning){tRunning=false;tPauseStart=Date.now();this.textContent=tr("Resume");}else{tPausedAccum+=Date.now()-tPauseStart;tPauseStart=0;tRunning=true;this.textContent=tr("Pause");}});
document.getElementById("tSkip").addEventListener("click",function(){if(!tRec)return;var now=Date.now();if(tPauseStart){tPausedAccum+=now-tPauseStart;tPauseStart=now;}var E=(now-tStart-tPausedAccum)/1000;var ps=tRec.pours,target=-1;for(var i=0;i<ps.length;i++){if(ps[i].t>E+0.2){target=ps[i].t;break;}}if(target<0)target=tRec.finishSec;tStart=now-tPausedAccum-Math.round(target*1000);tLastTick=-1;if(tRunning){tick();}else{tRunning=true;tick();tRunning=false;}});
document.getElementById("tReset").addEventListener("click",function(){tStart=Date.now();tPausedAccum=0;tPauseStart=0;tRunning=true;tLastIdx=-1;tLastTick=-1;tDone=false;document.getElementById("tPause").textContent=tr("Pause");tick();});
document.getElementById("tClose").addEventListener("click",function(){if(tElapsed>=60){recordTimerFinish();}tRunning=false;if(window.PENDING_VER)showUpdateBanner(window.PENDING_VER);if(tInterval){clearInterval(tInterval);tInterval=null;}document.getElementById("timerOverlay").classList.remove("show");});
function cmpVer(a,b){var pa=String(a).split(".").map(Number),pb=String(b).split(".").map(Number);for(var i=0;i<3;i++){var x=pa[i]||0,y=pb[i]||0;if(x>y)return 1;if(x<y)return -1;}return 0;}
